  "_comment": "Single source of truth for every measurement. tools/gen_catalog.py generates the firmware table (Catalog.gen.h) and the /api/meta document. reg = input register (function 4). type: u16 s16 u32 s32 lo8 hi8. quality: verified = cross-checked against real device data on 2026-10-20; documented = documented register with a plausible value but no independent cross-check; unverified = semantics or consistency not established. h1 = storage scale in the 1-minute/15-minute tiers (value = stored * h1), null = not stored per minute. agg15 = how the 15-minute tier aggregates it.",
